    <value>Skrinshot UZ — PrintScreen tugmasi</value>
    <comment>Oyna sarlavhasi</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="Permission_PrintScreen_Question" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Skrinshot UZ klaviaturadagi PrintScreen tugmasini ishlatishiga ruxsat berasizmi?</value>
    <comment>Vazifadagi aniq matn</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="Permission_Explanation" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Ruxsat bersangiz, PrintScreen bosilganda ekran xiralashadi va kerakli qismni sichqoncha bilan tanlab olasiz.

Alt+PrintScreen — faol oyna skrinshoti.
Shift+PrintScreen — butun ekran darhol saqlanadi.

Bu tanlovni keyin istalgan vaqtda soat yonidagi ikonka menyusidan o'zgartirish mumkin.</value>
  </data>
